content:
i have been on xiaohongshu for a few weeks (since a bit before the flooding of americans) and even when every single thing was in mandarin and i had to translate from screenshots to edit my settings it had already become my favorite app. it is extremely good for my mental health. the diversity and inclusion, the different viewpoints and walks of life, the number of happy people… this is what i was taught growing up to believe america was meant to be like… this app and the people on it are so positive and friendly and welcoming. it has encouraged me to try new things, to improve my skills, to explore new opportunities. i love this app. and now i’m starting to learn mandarin!

/// and translated into mandarin:

我已经使用小红书几个星期了（早在美国人涌入之前），即使每件事都是中文的，我必须从截图中翻译来编辑我的设置，它已经成为我最喜欢的应用程序。它对我的心理健康非常有益。多样性和包容性，不同的观点和各行各业，快乐的人的数量......这就是我成长过程中所学到的美国应该成为的样子。这个应用程序和上面的人都非常积极、友好和热情。它鼓励我尝试新事物，提高我的技能，探索新的机会。我喜欢这个应用程序。现在我开始学习普通话了！

